    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dazzling world of ice and artistry with <i>Figure Skating Legends</i>, the ultimate figure skating experience! Whether you're a seasoned skating enthusiast or a curious newcomer, this game invites you to glide, spin, and jump your way to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Own Programs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity by choreographing custom figure skating routines! Choose from a wide array of moves, including elegant spirals, breathtaking spins, and intricate footwork sequences. Add flair to your programs with six iconic jumps: Axel, Toe Loop, Loop, Flip, Salchow, and Lutz. Pair your choreography with music that matches your vision\u2014now, you can even upload your own music in MP3 or WAV format. Additionally, personalize your skater\u2019s appearance by uploading custom textures in PNG, JPEG, or JPG formats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Like a Pro</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technical Score:</strong> Earn points by executing precise elements, including jumps, step sequences, choreographic sequences, and spins. The better your execution, the higher your technical score, rewarding your mastery of figure skating's core techniques.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3de935705e87db0fc6ba7e540708fc1b.poster.avif?t=1751382494\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3de935705e87db0fc6ba7e540708fc1b.webm?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3de935705e87db0fc6ba7e540708fc1b.mp4?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3427bd3d645c2bf782861564047b2754.poster.avif?t=1751382494\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3427bd3d645c2bf782861564047b2754.webm?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3427bd3d645c2bf782861564047b2754.mp4?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Component Score:</strong> Enhance your artistry by synchronizing movements with the music and collecting components scattered across the ice. These components unlock additional animations, making your performance more dynamic and visually stunning while boosting your overall score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/936e603b13d118b2c1016e8fe9f80797.poster.avif?t=1751382494\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/936e603b13d118b2c1016e8fe9f80797.webm?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/936e603b13d118b2c1016e8fe9f80797.mp4?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete Against the Best</strong><br>Challenge players worldwide and climb the leaderboards! Perform your routines and earn scores based on artistry, technique, and execution. Can you achieve a perfect score and earn the title of &quot;Legendary Skater&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Career Mode</strong><br>Start your journey as a beginner skater and rise through the ranks. Compete in regional tournaments, impress international judges, and earn your spot at the prestigious Legends Championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Skating Physics</strong><br>Experience realistic skating mechanics that bring the ice to life. Perfect your timing to land stunning combinations, or risk it all with ambitious moves. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong><br>Immerse yourself in breathtaking arenas and detailed costumes that capture the glamour of figure skating. Customize your character's look with options to express your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Skater</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the rink as either a male or female skater, each with unique animations and customizable outfits. Express your style and personality as you compete to become a legend on the ice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong><br>While inspired by the artistry and athleticism of real-world figure skating, <i>Figure Skating Legends</i> is an independent game and has <strong>no affiliation with the International Skating Union (ISU)</strong> or any official figure skating organisations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the ice and become a legend in <i>Figure Skating Legends</i>! The rink awaits your artistry and skill\u2014are you ready to leave your mark?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dazzling world of ice and artistry with <i>Figure Skating Legends</i>, the ultimate figure skating experience! Whether you're a seasoned skating enthusiast or a curious newcomer, this game invites you to glide, spin, and jump your way to glory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Own Programs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity by choreographing custom figure skating routines! Choose from a wide array of moves, including elegant spirals, breathtaking spins, and intricate footwork sequences. Add flair to your programs with six iconic jumps: Axel, Toe Loop, Loop, Flip, Salchow, and Lutz. Pair your choreography with music that matches your vision\u2014now, you can even upload your own music in MP3 or WAV format. Additionally, personalize your skater\u2019s appearance by uploading custom textures in PNG, JPEG, or JPG formats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score Like a Pro</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technical Score:</strong> Earn points by executing precise elements, including jumps, step sequences, choreographic sequences, and spins. The better your execution, the higher your technical score, rewarding your mastery of figure skating's core techniques.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3de935705e87db0fc6ba7e540708fc1b.poster.avif?t=1751382494\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3de935705e87db0fc6ba7e540708fc1b.webm?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3de935705e87db0fc6ba7e540708fc1b.mp4?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3427bd3d645c2bf782861564047b2754.poster.avif?t=1751382494\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3427bd3d645c2bf782861564047b2754.webm?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/3427bd3d645c2bf782861564047b2754.mp4?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Component Score:</strong> Enhance your artistry by synchronizing movements with the music and collecting components scattered across the ice. These components unlock additional animations, making your performance more dynamic and visually stunning while boosting your overall score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/936e603b13d118b2c1016e8fe9f80797.poster.avif?t=1751382494\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/936e603b13d118b2c1016e8fe9f80797.webm?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357130/extras/936e603b13d118b2c1016e8fe9f80797.mp4?t=1751382494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete Against the Best</strong><br>Challenge players worldwide and climb the leaderboards! Perform your routines and earn scores based on artistry, technique, and execution. Can you achieve a perfect score and earn the title of &quot;Legendary Skater&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Career Mode</strong><br>Start your journey as a beginner skater and rise through the ranks. Compete in regional tournaments, impress international judges, and earn your spot at the prestigious Legends Championship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Skating Physics</strong><br>Experience realistic skating mechanics that bring the ice to life. Perfect your timing to land stunning combinations, or risk it all with ambitious moves. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization</strong><br>Immerse yourself in breathtaking arenas and detailed costumes that capture the glamour of figure skating. Customize your character's look with options to express your unique style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Skater</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the rink as either a male or female skater, each with unique animations and customizable outfits. Express your style and personality as you compete to become a legend on the ice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong><br>While inspired by the artistry and athleticism of real-world figure skating, <i>Figure Skating Legends</i> is an independent game and has <strong>no affiliation with the International Skating Union (ISU)</strong> or any official figure skating organisations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the ice and become a legend in <i>Figure Skating Legends</i>! The rink awaits your artistry and skill\u2014are you ready to leave your mark?</p>",
